# Pulseq sequence file
# Hand-written fixture of pulseq-analysis, not made by a Pulseq tool.
# The buffer of the extended trapezoids of a block (decodeExtTrapGradInBlock, cpp:2155-2196):
# the time shape 3 of gradient 2 is "0 0 -2", which writes none of its 4 samples. In block 0
# (gradient 2 alone on gx) it keeps an empty buffer; in block 1 (gradient 1 on gx, gradient 2 on
# gy) it keeps the wave shape of gradient 1. spec rejects the file.

